// CANADA. Departments: income tax (CRA, Revenu Québec, Alberta), sales tax (GST/HST, QST, provincial sales
// taxes), payroll and slips, and the federal corporate annual return. Every due date and threshold marked
// verified: true was read on the official page listed in `sources` on the date shown there. A filing whose rule
// could not be read on the official page (all of Revenu Québec, which refused the request) carries
// verified: false and is shown to the person as "confirm on the official source".
